Package: RiboPilot
Title: Nuclear ribosomal repeat assembly, annotation, and curation
Version: 0.0.0.9004
Authors@R: c(
    person("Dan", "MacGuigan", , "macguigand@si.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: An R package for nuclear ribosomal repeat (18S-ITS1-5.8S-ITS2-28S)
    assembly, annotation, and curation from genome skimming data. Sister package
    to MitoPilot; uses Nextflow for execution and includes an R-Shiny app for
    project management and curation of results.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/dmacguigan/RiboPilot
BugReports: https://github.com/dmacguigan/RiboPilot/issues
